# Procedure: ADR Creating

1. Choose next ADR number (e.g., 001) and create file `.cursor/decisions/adr-XXX.mdc`.
2. Add YAML header with minimal metadata:
   ```yaml
   ---
   adr: XXX
   title: "Short, imperative title"
   status: drafted # [drafted|accepted|rejected|superseded]
   created: YYYY-MM-DD
   supersedes: null
   superseded_by: null
   ---
   ```
3. Document Context, Decision, Consequences, Alternatives.
4. Link related tasks `[task:NNN]` and rules `[rule:dict]` if applicable.
5. When accepted, update `status: accepted` and cross-link if it supersedes/gets superseded.
6. Run `pnpm run index:decisions` to refresh index.

